ly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Yeah I guess this is fine.\r\nThe `TriangleMesh` is a bit dodgy internally in places but I guess it can be replaced if the API remains the same.\r\n\r\nReturning things from a \"performance\" function in a `Dictionary` is a bit scary, but I guess Godot has form on this. It seems difficult to return multiple values from bound functions efficiently.\r\n\r\nGrok suggested also options:\r\n* Arrays\r\n* Custom Object\r\n* Tuples (new in 4.3)\r\n\r\nBut I guess those could be added in a later bound function. Dictionary does offer some advantages as hedging against changes in what is returned.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104625#pullrequestreview-2735157350","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104625","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104625#pullrequestreview-2735157350"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104625"}},"submitted_at":"2025-04-02T08:24:03Z","commit_id":"f2197a1013958a4d5bb2edf104b190b6474e1872"}]